        "raw": "<p>Could someone give me the card count of all the non-hero/enviorments that come in Oblivaeon (aeon men, missions etc). I can&#39;t find it anywhere and I want to make sure I got everything.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Same thing for the promos and the foil villian cards.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Thanks very much for your help!</p>",
