        "created_at": "2018-08-28T22:30:18.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Oooo, I forgot the variant villains -- that's six more, plus there's an extra one for Hammer and Anvil, and there are foil cards for the Inevitable Destruction chart and the Scion Reserve. That would be a total of 59, plus the booklet, which is how many I actually have.</p>",
